    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Is each service running, and in which version?",
      "description": "Every service this machine runs for Holochain and beside it, one row each, by name, worst first, with the version of what it runs and when it last started. The machine lists them itself, from the nixos-holochain modules enabled on it (services.holochain-services.units), and the monitor's services.holochain-grafana.overviewUnits may add more. Each version comes from the Nix package the service runs, not from asking the service, so it is the version this machine was built with; a dash means the service has none worth naming, or the machine was built before services carried versions. The states are the node page's: Failed, Stopped and Not answering are down; Not answering means systemd says the service runs but it does not answer its health check or, for a conductor, its admin interface; No fresh readings means nobody has checked it lately. A Holochain conductor another program runs, with no service of its own here, has a row of its own, such as \"Holochain conductor (Moss)\".",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "holochain-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 11
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "holochain-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "label_replace(holochain:service_state{node=\"$node\"}, \"version\", \"-\", \"version\", \"\")",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "holochain-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max by (node, name) (node_systemd_unit_start_time_seconds{node=\"$node\"} > 0) * 1000 and on (node, name) holochain:service_watched{node=\"$node\"}",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "merge",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "filterFieldsByName",
          "options": {
            "include": {
              "names": [
                "service",
                "Value #A",
                "version",
                "Value #B"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {},
            "indexByName": {
              "service": 0,
              "Value #A": 1,
              "version": 2,
              "Value #B": 3
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "service": "Service",
              "Value #A": "State",
              "version": "Version",
              "Value #B": "Started"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            }
          },
          "noValue": "This machine lists no services: it needs node_exporter's textfile collector and services.holochain-services.textfileDirectory"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "State"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "0": {
                        "text": "Failed",
                        "color": "red",
                        "index": 0
                      },
                      "1": {
                        "text": "Stopped",
                        "color": "red",
                        "index": 1
                      },
                      "2": {
                        "text": "Not answering",
                        "color": "red",
                        "index": 2
                      },
                      "3": {
                        "text": "No fresh readings",
                        "color": "orange",
                        "index": 3
                      },
                      "4": {
                        "text": "Starting",
                        "color": "#EAB839",
                        "index": 4
                      },
                      "5": {
                        "text": "Stopping",
                        "color": "#EAB839",
                        "index": 5
                      },
                      "6": {
                        "text": "Running",
                        "color": "green",
                        "index": 6
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-background",
                  "mode": "basic"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Started"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "dateTimeFromNow"
              },
              {
                "id": "noValue",
                "value": "-"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Version"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "noValue",
                "value": "-"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        },
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "displayName": "State",
            "desc": false
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Which Holochain conductors run here?",
      "description": "Each Holochain conductor on this machine, by the name its readings carry, with the service that runs it, the Holochain version it is, and whether it answers: Not answering when it does not answer its admin interface, No fresh readings when its readings are old, Running otherwise. The Holochain version comes from the Nix package the service runs; a Moss node brings its own Holochain, which can differ from the machine's own conductor. A dash means no service here claims the conductor, or the machine was built before services carried versions. Click a conductor to see its apps part by part on the node page.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "holochain-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20,
        "w": 10,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "holochain-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "label_replace(label_replace(\n  holochain:conductor_state{node=\"$node\"}\n    * on (instance, conductor) group_left (service, holochain_version)\n  max by (instance, conductor, service, holochain_version) (holochain_service_info{node=\"$node\", conductor!=\"\"})\n  or on (instance, conductor) holochain:conductor_state{node=\"$node\"},\n  \"holochain_version\", \"-\", \"holochain_version\", \"\"),\n  \"service\", \"-\", \"service\", \"\")",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "filterFieldsByName",
          "options": {
            "include": {
              "names": [
                "conductor",
                "service",
                "holochain_version",
                "Value"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {},
            "indexByName": {
              "conductor": 0,
              "service": 1,
              "holochain_version": 2,
              "Value": 3
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "conductor": "Conductor",
